  "releaseNotes": "### 🏗️ Breaking changes\n\n* *(ripple-dom)* Require Glutinum.Web 1.0.0-beta.11 ([6f7b4ea](https://github.com/fable-hub/Fable.Ripple/commit/6f7b4eacc7b0a8829d74e740c597e58027f3c068))\n\n### 🚀 Features\n\n* *(ripple-dom)* Add number-valued attribute bindings ([3a6827f](https://github.com/fable-hub/Fable.Ripple/commit/3a6827f9a48bdbfc453bcc9042483d0f8bac4d98))\n* *(ripple-dom)* Add a raw Event overload for on.change ([e7c4a75](https://github.com/fable-hub/Fable.Ripple/commit/e7c4a75cf89dbd2d05106030aa0c931042883702))\n* *(ripple-dom)* Add attr.styleProperty ([eedbcf1](https://github.com/fable-hub/Fable.Ripple/commit/eedbcf1adea0259db648f1dfae4f7428717c5a04))\n\n<strong><small>[View changes on Github](https://github.com/fable-hub/Fable.Ripple/compare/ecfe7b4bda868df2e15d8b792c71d30e7e5b353a..eedbcf1adea0259db648f1dfae4f7428717c5a04)</small></strong>",
